  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine Emergency Response - PI Ukraine - 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUMMARY
In response to the humanitarian crisis in Ukraine, following the escalation of hostilities in February 2022, 11 Dutch collaborating aid organizations join forces under Giro555 to provide life-saving aid to affected-people in Ukraine and neighboring countries. This project aims to provide an urgent winterization support for the most vulnerable people in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
